{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/extras/a265e25626b87a3280a752d81db045ef.poster.avif?t=1757540335\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/extras/a265e25626b87a3280a752d81db045ef.webm?t=1757540335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/extras/a265e25626b87a3280a752d81db045ef.mp4?t=1757540335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ember Island is a nostalgic 2D action-adventure game that blends the timeless soul of retro classics with modern design, graphics, and gameplay. Step into a hand-crafted world inspired by the beloved side-scrollers of classic 8 and 16-bit consoles.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/extras/8feb60715dc56a0a21eca05eb6fb8cb1.poster.avif?t=1757540335\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/extras/8feb60715dc56a0a21eca05eb6fb8cb1.webm?t=1757540335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/extras/8feb60715dc56a0a21eca05eb6fb8cb1.mp4?t=1757540335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a hero for hire, you'll explore a vibrant environment, engage in fast-paced combat, and discover a world brimming with unique challenges. We've built Ember Island for players who grew up with a controller in their hands and now seek a quality adventure that respects their time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Side-Scrolling Action:</strong> Run, jump, and fight your way through a beautifully crafted 2D world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Playable Characters</strong>\u00a0with unique melee and magical attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle</strong> your way through 30 unique enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive, Modern Combat:</strong> Experience a responsive combat system that's easy to learn but difficult to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artful Pixel Design:</strong> Immerse yourself in a modern pixel art style that honors the classics while bringing a fresh, vibrant feel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Encounters:</strong> Test your skills against epic bosses designed to challenge your reflexes and wits.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3976950?t=1757540335","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/d7792f68696c5ec31a302dd5c9751b95f996d96f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757540335","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/52798da309da4bab5087e098665be84bb76eeb22/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757540335","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/52798da309da4bab5087e098665be84bb76eeb22/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757540335","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/extras/a265e25626b87a3280a752d81db045ef.poster.avif?t=1757540335\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/extras/a265e25626b87a3280a752d81db045ef.webm?t=1757540335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/extras/a265e25626b87a3280a752d81db045ef.mp4?t=1757540335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ember Island is a nostalgic 2D action-adventure game that blends the timeless soul of retro classics with modern design, graphics, and gameplay. Step into a hand-crafted world inspired by the beloved side-scrollers of classic 8 and 16-bit consoles.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/extras/8feb60715dc56a0a21eca05eb6fb8cb1.poster.avif?t=1757540335\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/extras/8feb60715dc56a0a21eca05eb6fb8cb1.webm?t=1757540335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/extras/8feb60715dc56a0a21eca05eb6fb8cb1.mp4?t=1757540335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a hero for hire, you'll explore a vibrant environment, engage in fast-paced combat, and discover a world brimming with unique challenges. We've built Ember Island for players who grew up with a controller in their hands and now seek a quality adventure that respects their time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Side-Scrolling Action:</strong> Run, jump, and fight your way through a beautifully crafted 2D world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Playable Characters</strong>\u00a0with unique melee and magical attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle</strong> your way through 30 unique enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive, Modern Combat:</strong> Experience a responsive combat system that's easy to learn but difficult to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artful Pixel Design:</strong> Immerse yourself in a modern pixel art style that honors the classics while bringing a fresh, vibrant feel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Encounters:</strong> Test your skills against epic bosses designed to challenge your reflexes and wits.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Calibus Creations LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/062e14b61cb20f21ff6c87a90cf496b507caba60/header.jpg?t=1757540335","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257191443,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191443/movie480.mp4?t=1756694271","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191443/movie_max.mp4?t=1756694271"},"name":"Ember Island Game Play Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257191443/0af40383995a8dced1d01014ffe3acd5da52f117/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756694271","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191443